@startuml
title Graderate State Transition Diagram

state "Waiting State" as WaitingState
state ActiveState
state ExpiredState
state ArchivedState

[*] --> WaitingState

' Entry behavior for states
WaitingState : entry/Rate created and waiting for start date
ActiveState : entry/Rate activated upon reaching start date
ExpiredState : entry/Rate expired after finish date
ArchivedState : entry/Rate archived or removed after one year of expiration

' Transitions based on events
WaitingState --> ActiveState : current date >= start date / activate rate

ActiveState --> ExpiredState : current date > finish date / mark as expired

ExpiredState --> ArchivedState : current date > (finish date + 1 year) / archive or remove rate

ArchivedState --> [*]

@enduml
